    {
      "source": "Creates a new <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a> by converting the given <a href=\"../Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> into a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.SliceMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel.SliceMetadata</code></a> instance and\nusing the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a> to turn elements of the <a href=\"../Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a> into resources.",
      "translation": "通过给定的<a href=\"../Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>转换为<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.SliceMetadata.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel.SliceMetadata</code></a>实例，并创建一个新的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a>，同时使用给定的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a>将<a href=\"../Slice.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.domain\"><code>Slice</code></a>中的元素转换为资源。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/SlicedModel.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas\"><code>SlicedModel</code></a> with an empty collection <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-hateoas/docs/current/api/org/springframework/hateoas/server/core/EmbeddedWrapper.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.hateoas.server.core\"><code>EmbeddedWrapper</code></a> for the given domain type.",
